# 3D assets, served from public/ and copied verbatim into dist/. Track only the
# five files the app actually references (all now under GitHub's 100MB hard
# limit after the warehouse model was recompressed) — anything else dropped
# into this folder (leftover exports, WIP assets) stays untracked, so a stray
# multi-hundred-MB export can't get committed by accident. See CLAUDE.md →
# "Models are sized in METRES".
public/models/*
!public/models/ImageToStl.com_warehouse6 (2).glb
!public/models/industrial robot controller 3d model.glb
!public/models/amazon model.glb
!public/models/robot 1.glb
!public/models/white shipping box 3d model.glb
